  "bio": "Discover the artistic sanctuary of Gold Heart Tattoo, nestled in the heart of La Crosse, where the ink comes to life with vivid illustrative styles. This studio doubles as an art gallery, featuring the works of renowned resident artists like @brokenmissyface, @zanedeckertattoos, @sonasam, and @landonsheely. Step into Gold Heart Tattoo, where every design is a masterpiece waiting to adorn your skin.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: La Crosse, Wisconsin, United States\n\nNo dms!\n-\nTattoos:\n@brokenmissyface \n@zanedeckertattoos\n@sonasam \n-",
